@host = http://localhost:8099

### Upsert a customer-owned record
POST {{host}}/api/customer-runtime/records
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "id": "acct-1001",
  "tenantId": "tenant-acme",
  "title": "Acme onboarding policy",
  "content": "Acme enterprise accounts require security review before rollout.",
  "version": "1"
}

### Search within tenant
GET {{host}}/api/customer-runtime/search?tenantId=tenant-acme&q=security

### Write action requires confirmation
POST {{host}}/api/customer-runtime/actions/execute
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "actionId": "create_follow_up_task",
  "recordId": "acct-1001",
  "accessMode": "WRITE_ONLY",
  "params": {"assignee": "csm-maya"},
  "confirmed": false
}

### Confirm write action
POST {{host}}/api/customer-runtime/actions/execute
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "actionId": "create_follow_up_task",
  "recordId": "acct-1001",
  "accessMode": "WRITE_ONLY",
  "params": {"assignee": "csm-maya"},
  "confirmed": true
}

### Simulate connector outage
POST {{host}}/api/customer-runtime/connector/availability?available=false

### Outage returns structured failure
POST {{host}}/api/customer-runtime/actions/execute
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "actionId": "create_follow_up_task",
  "recordId": "acct-1001",
  "accessMode": "WRITE_ONLY",
  "confirmed": true
}

### Delete record
DELETE {{host}}/api/customer-runtime/records/acct-1001
